# Build context exclusions for a context of ./frontend (Dockerfile.dev only -- the production
# Dockerfile builds from the repository root and uses the root .dockerignore).
#
# `node_modules` is the one that matters: the dev image runs `npm ci` itself, and the host tree
# carries Windows-only native binaries (@esbuild/win32-x64, @rollup/rollup-win32-x64-msvc) that a
# Linux container cannot load. It is also shadowed by an anonymous volume in docker-compose.yml, so
# the bind mount of this directory does not put it back at run time.
node_modules
dist
.vite
*.local
Dockerfile.dev
